# Keeps Docker build contexts small and avoids leaking local/dev-only files
# into images. The compose build context for every service is the repo root
# (see docker-compose.yml's `context: .`), so without this file, every build
# would upload git history, all projects' bin/obj folders, node_modules, and
# actual media libraries under data/ — multiple GB of irrelevant data on
# every build.

.git/
.github/
.idea/
.claude/

**/bin/
**/obj/
**/node_modules/

# Local/dev-only data and config — never needed inside an image; media is
# always mounted at runtime via docker-compose.yml's volumes instead.
# (**/ so this also catches HoloNet.Games/data/, not just the repo-root one.)
**/data/
**/appsettings.Development.json
**/appsettings.local.json

# TV launcher is a Windows desktop client, never containerized.
HoloNet.TvLauncher/

# Misc local artifacts that shouldn't end up in build contexts.
*.md
*.psu
*.png
docs/
